lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhao Li is a community gardening enthusiast, she does not like to listen to other people's opinions. In a garden competition, her garden wins the community \"Best Garden\" award, she also shares her garden photos on the community forum.\n\n[Question]\nZhao Li should be proud of her garden winning the award, but why does she become angry?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhao Li's neighbors come to her garden for a visit, trampling on the garden's land, this makes her angry.\nB. Zhao Li finds a flower in her garden is stolen.\nC. Zhao Li finds out her trophy is fake, this makes her angry.\nD. Zhao Li's neighbors make some negative and jealous comments about her garden on the forum.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0024725242656540272,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58cae9aa9dc5a833d59f7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477230994,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:53:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"44625207e8ee41458b81af90f7d48861"}